OL,4,G0350FWitness History
OL,5,     GOn 26 January 1926, John Logie
OL,6,     GBaird demonstrated his
OL,7,     G'televisor' in public. It was the
OL,8,     Gprototype for television. His
OL,9,     Ggrandson, Iain Logie Baird, spoke
OL,10,     Gabout it in 2010.
OL,11,G0400FBBC News
OL,12,G0406FThe Newsroom
OL,13,     GThe world's Newsroom brings you
OL,14,     Gglobal events as they happen.
OL,15,G0430FBBC News Summary
OL,16,G0432FIn the Studio
OL,17,     GSheetal Parmar on the delicate
OL,18,     Gsculptures of artist Mrinalini
OL,19,     GMukherjee along with works from
OL,20,     Gher circle of friends, family and
OL,21,     Gteachers who helped to shape
OL,22,     GIndian modernism.
